//@version=6
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//  BASE HITS — Sessions · Liquidity Raids · Session Stats
//
//  One overlay that reproduces the "base hits" workflow:
//    • Killzone session boxes (ASIA / LNDN / NYAM / NYPM) with their highs and
//      lows extended to the right until price takes them out.
//    • Previous day / week / month highs, lows and the previous daily close.
//    • A supertrend-anchored trend cloud (bull = green, bear = pink).
//    • BUY LR / SELL LR liquidity-raid signals — price sweeps resting liquidity
//      (a session level, an HTF level or a swing pivot) and closes back inside.
//    • A projected trade: red risk box to the stop, green reward box to the
//      target at a fixed R multiple, extended forward until it resolves.
//    • A stats table: for each session/period, the average range plus how often
//      its high and its low get swept afterwards.
//    • Bar-close countdown next to price.
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
indicator("Base HITS — Sessions · Liquidity Raids · Stats", "Base HITS", overlay = true,
     max_boxes_count = 500, max_lines_count = 500, max_labels_count = 500)

// ─────────────────────────────── INPUTS ───────────────────────────────────
